scenario 2
tick_rate 60
# The world view never stops the game: from the act II town the player
# warps into two of its outdoor levels; after each the game still runs and
# the view draws a frame with map tiles, with no frame skipped.
name view-warp-act2
seed 1234
end 420
char class 1
char level 30
char area 1 40
at 0 dev god on
at 0 poke warp 43
by 150 check player.area == 43
